    "detailed_description": "<strong>KVLT </strong>(reads as CULT) is a grimdark single player first person shooter where visceral old school combat meets Cthulhu Mythos. <br><br>In <strong>KVLT </strong>you are <i>Lazar</i>, a five hundred years old occultist and cold blooded fighter, following a trail of arcane knowledge lost to the annals of history, in an effort to find magical artifacts of untold power, destroying whoever dares to cross your path in the process.<br><br>This first adventure takes you to the year <strong>1945</strong>, the nazis are losing the war. Unscrupulous and desperate, a last-ditch effort is made: relying on a secret task force specialized in paranormal warfare, known as Fenrir, they seek to recover the <i>technology and knowledge from ancient civilizations</i>, in an attempt to change the tides of war in favor of the Reich.<br><br>But, what they don't know\u2026 is that they are about to cross your line of fire.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2113960/extras/409891e696456ea503d7ed8e1729d38f.poster.avif?t=1732803338\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2113960/extras/409891e696456ea503d7ed8e1729d38f.webm?t=1732803338\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2113960/extras/409891e696456ea503d7ed8e1729d38f.mp4?t=1732803338\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>- Experience a <strong>single player campaign</strong> filled with <strong>high-octane action</strong> and <strong>weird fiction paraphernalia</strong>, inspired by your favorite early 2000\u2019s shooters, like: <i>Doom 3</i>, <i>Return To Castle Wolfenstein</i>, <i>Wolfenstein (2009)</i>, <i>Half-Life 2</i>, <i>The Darkness</i>, <i>NecroVisioN</i>, and infused with the cosmic horrors from <i>H.P Lovecraft's Cthulhu Mythos</i>.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2113960/extras/f16551eeb82771cd3d93ca5d69087c45.poster.avif?t=1732803338\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2113960/extras/f16551eeb82771cd3d93ca5d69087c45.webm?t=1732803338\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2113960/extras/f16551eeb82771cd3d93ca5d69087c45.mp4?t=1732803338\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>-  Arm yourself with Lazar's <i>unique </i>arsenal and use your firepower to combat terrible enemies: <strong>nazi occultists</strong>, <strong>religious zealots</strong>, and of course, <strong>eldritch abominations of unknowable nature</strong>.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2113960/extras/486b77886655144fe971d84ca96fda53.poster.avif?t=1732803338\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2113960/extras/486b77886655144fe971d84ca96fda53.webm?t=1732803338\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2113960/extras/486b77886655144fe971d84ca96fda53.mp4?t=1732803338\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>- Each gun has been modified and decorated with arcane talismans in order to channel your unholy warlock magic. Shoot powerful bursts of destructive energy and unlock <i>unique functionalities</i> that can be <i>combined</i>!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2113960/extras/1ac2df839c6c69456d7139465ad124c9.poster.avif?t=1732803338\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2113960/extras/1ac2df839c6c69456d7139465ad124c9.webm?t=1732803338\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2113960/extras/1ac2df839c6c69456d7139465ad124c9.mp4?t=1732803338\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>- Cast a deadly spell: use <strong>Eldritch magic</strong> to unlock your third eye and glare beyond the veil of reality in order to find secret areas, solve puzzles and overcome the supernatural challenges that hide within the battlefield. If you are looking for a more \u2018direct\u2019 approach then shield yourself with mystic energies capable of absorbing the most vicious attacks, and then rush towards your enemies, guns blazing.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2113960/extras/29722410701ba83a33ea5744cfacef30.poster.avif?t=1732803338\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2113960/extras/29722410701ba83a33ea5744cfacef30.webm?t=1732803338\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2113960/extras/29722410701ba83a33ea5744cfacef30.mp4?t=1732803338\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>- Enjoy <strong>Evil Guinea Pig</strong>'s trademark of <i>visceral gameplay</i> and <i>grimdark worldbuilding</i>.",
